{"4988500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "5th Frontier, The New Space Race", "steam_appid": 4988500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5038230], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve and Design your own planets, ships and units, the way you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design giant Armored Battle Stations, like from Star Wars, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or Design Giant Space Ships like from Battlestar Galactica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle vast numbers of enemies, each with their own setup and tech focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can micromanage (Macro-manage) an entire universe, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or just set it on autopilot, and focus on the battle part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to that; Mega-structures like Space Colonies and Planet size Rings, like from Halo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 4x Turn-Based Single Player Strategic Space game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build Your own fleet of space ships, to conquer the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is inspired by the old game VGA Planets, and the Space Empire Series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/extras/ff9e7e37db3a41549ca700ca4fc28d8f.poster.avif?t=1788243115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/extras/ff9e7e37db3a41549ca700ca4fc28d8f.webm?t=1788243115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/extras/ff9e7e37db3a41549ca700ca4fc28d8f.mp4?t=1788243115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This goes beyond traditional 4X games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 5th 'X' is the era of mega-engineering and harvesting the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXplore: You send scouts to uncover the map, and later the whole universe; Finding hidden places and new planets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXpand: You claim new planets and colonize them to building cities or facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXploit: You gather resources from your facilites to make your empire stronger and richer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXterminate: You attack your rivals to remove them from the game, or to do gunboat diplomacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXamine: Do research, explore the vaste Tech tree and build your own specialized Tech Tree.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXchange (Diplomacy, Espionage &amp; Trade): </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXcavate (Salvaging &amp; Reverse-Engineering)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve and Design your own planets, ships and units, the way you like it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design giant Armored Battle Stations, like from Star Wars, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or Design Giant Space Ships like from Battlestar Galactica.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle vast numbers of enemies, each with their own setup and tech focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can micromanage (Macro-manage) an entire universe, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or just set it on autopilot, and focus on the battle part of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to that; Mega-structures like Space Colonies and Planet size Rings, like from Halo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 4x Turn-Based Single Player Strategic Space game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build Your own fleet of space ships, to conquer the Galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is inspired by the old game VGA Planets, and the Space Empire Series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/extras/ff9e7e37db3a41549ca700ca4fc28d8f.poster.avif?t=1788243115\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/extras/ff9e7e37db3a41549ca700ca4fc28d8f.webm?t=1788243115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/extras/ff9e7e37db3a41549ca700ca4fc28d8f.mp4?t=1788243115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This goes beyond traditional 4X games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 5th 'X' is the era of mega-engineering and harvesting the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXplore: You send scouts to uncover the map, and later the whole universe; Finding hidden places and new planets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXpand: You claim new planets and colonize them to building cities or facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXploit: You gather resources from your facilites to make your empire stronger and richer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXterminate: You attack your rivals to remove them from the game, or to do gunboat diplomacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXamine: Do research, explore the vaste Tech tree and build your own specialized Tech Tree.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXchange (Diplomacy, Espionage &amp; Trade): </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXcavate (Salvaging &amp; Reverse-Engineering)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 4x Turn-Based Single Player Strategic Space game. Design and build Your own fleet of space ships, to conquer the Galaxy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/ea0ecedc81422c5164e9968f8cf84f51367f39da/header.jpg?t=1788243115", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/5cba1af689e2711f86407348bcafcc397850fe69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788243115", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988500/5cba1af689e2711f86407348bcafcc397850fe69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788243115", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Basic<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Basic<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Basic</li></ul